  "sourceData": {
    "answer": "wish/dream/prayer/one's-desire",
    "mnemonic": "You know that an <ja>お願い</ja> is a request, and that <ja>事</ja> is a \"thing\" or \"action.\" So, this is a \"request action,\" in a sense. A better way to say that is <vocabulary>one's wish</vocabulary> or a <vocabulary>prayer</vocabulary>, because that's what you're doing when you do the action of requesting something.",
    "readingMnemonic": "The readings come from the words <ja>お願い</ja> and <ja>事</ja>. If you know how to read those you should be able to read this word too."
